{"schemaVersion":1,"storyId":"one-bread-two-friends","version":1,"title":"One Bread, Two Friends","ageTiers":["5-6","7-8"],"language":"en","narrationLocale":"en-GH","pages":[{"n":1,"text":"It was break time. Ayeley put her hand in her bag. Her lunch box was not there! ‘Oh no,’ she said. ‘I forgot my lunch.’","sentences":["It was break time.","Ayeley put her hand in her bag.","Her lunch box was not there!","‘Oh no,’ she said.","‘I forgot my lunch.’"],"alt":"A girl looks into an empty bag at a school desk.","image":{"hash":"sha256:59d2352fcbf844cf63b05630df7d22e9f12efa32fb21c6880a818dfaa727789d","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:69496918628d4cfb5d861492456dc8f97286fb8abe504efe3498f1058d986742","durationMs":17120,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2870],[2870,7409],[7409,11614],[11614,14250],[14250,17120]],"words":[[0,334],[334,834],[834,1669],[1669,2870],[2870,3871],[3871,4372],[4372,4872],[4872,5540],[5540,5874],[5874,6374],[6374,7409],[7409,7909],[7909,8744],[8744,9244],[9244,9745],[9745,10245],[10245,11614],[11614,11947],[11947,12548],[12548,13049],[13049,14250],[14250,14417],[14417,15418],[15418,15752],[15752,17120]]}}},{"n":2,"text":"Her tummy rumbled. Grr, grr, grr! She did not tell anybody. She sat still and looked at her desk.","sentences":["Her tummy rumbled.","Grr, grr, grr!","She did not tell anybody.","She sat still and looked at her desk."],"alt":"A girl sits quietly with her hands on her tummy while others eat.","image":{"hash":"sha256:a7e952bc6969afd94066134309414ea0e06514fbd31e093ca5c7fc72e1a6c1ab","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:f3790536da93fd95530774078cabe574fdba7e36b3fa6f5a74f85fb8740f2d6d","durationMs":12160,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2487],[2487,4591],[4591,7761],[7761,12160]],"words":[[0,410],[410,1093],[1093,2487],[2487,3115],[3115,3744],[3744,4591],[4591,5001],[5001,5411],[5411,5820],[5820,6367],[6367,7761],[7761,8170],[8170,8580],[8580,9263],[9263,9673],[9673,10493],[10493,10766],[10766,11176],[11176,12160]]}}},{"n":3,"text":"Kofitse sat beside her. He heard her tummy. ‘Are you hungry?’ he asked. Ayeley nodded a tiny nod. ‘I forgot my lunch,’ she whispered.","sentences":["Kofitse sat beside her.","He heard her tummy.","‘Are you hungry?’ he asked.","Ayeley nodded a tiny nod.","‘I forgot my lunch,’ she whispered."],"alt":"A boy turns to a girl whose tummy rumbles.","image":{"hash":"sha256:65e8b9ebe3a207289e6b1a2cb88a54b6303328f5d7c36bf46342901a9f77aa44","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:24b5960a65e5c6fc9120bd9bc6994320ac555088947d82ec69c89fded37d3273","durationMs":19880,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3684],[3684,6704],[6704,10919],[10919,14769],[14769,19880]],"words":[[0,1162],[1162,1659],[1659,2655],[2655,3684],[3684,4016],[4016,4846],[4846,5343],[5343,6704],[6704,7202],[7202,7700],[7700,9226],[9226,9558],[9558,10919],[10919,11915],[11915,12910],[12910,13076],[13076,13740],[13740,14769],[14769,14935],[14935,15931],[15931,16262],[16262,17358],[17358,17855],[17855,19880]]}}},{"n":4,"text":"Kofitse had bread and an egg. He broke his bread in two. He gave her half. ‘Here,’ he said. ‘We can share.’","sentences":["Kofitse had bread and an egg.","He broke his bread in two.","He gave her half.","‘Here,’ he said.","‘We can share.’"],"alt":"A boy breaks a piece of bread and gives half to a girl.","image":{"hash":"sha256:036e48dc35bd7bf0284b9dad843bf785f540680bc7217d1014f801527ae83f62","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:a452f8ae245af753fb4806579b2d08e62396fba3b03965e87ffb14bf66bced6c","durationMs":12320,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3449],[3449,6502],[6502,8635],[8635,10583],[10583,12320]],"words":[[0,921],[921,1316],[1316,1974],[1974,2369],[2369,2632],[2632,3449],[3449,3712],[3712,4370],[4370,4765],[4765,5423],[5423,5686],[5686,6502],[6502,6765],[6765,7292],[7292,7687],[7687,8635],[8635,9372],[9372,9635],[9635,10583],[10583,10846],[10846,11241],[11241,12320]]}}},{"n":5,"text":"He cut the egg in two as well. Now they each had half a piece of bread and half an egg. ‘Thank you,’ said Ayeley. She smiled.","sentences":["He cut the egg in two as well.","Now they each had half a piece of bread and half an egg.","‘Thank you,’ said Ayeley.","She smiled."],"alt":"Two children eat bread and egg together at a desk.","image":{"hash":"sha256:8abed8eba5159041679d2356a8052e2aa9865ec95d2e221c4aa76eba5e40748a","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:c68809e4f860a471b089917baeb8708cbb25399d16476245cc0aa5448a529a1c","durationMs":15720,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,3723],[3723,10549],[10549,13918],[13918,15720]],"words":[[0,295],[295,739],[739,1182],[1182,1625],[1625,1921],[1921,2364],[2364,2659],[2659,3723],[3723,4166],[4166,4757],[4757,5348],[5348,5792],[5792,6383],[6383,6530],[6530,7269],[7269,7565],[7565,8303],[8303,8746],[8746,9337],[9337,9633],[9633,10549],[10549,11288],[11288,11967],[11967,12558],[12558,13918],[13918,14361],[14361,15720]]}}},{"n":6,"text":"Madam Aduku saw them. ‘That was kind, Kofitse,’ she said. ‘When we share, everybody has something. And we should tell a grown-up when we are hungry.’","sentences":["Madam Aduku saw them.","‘That was kind, Kofitse,’ she said.","‘When we share, everybody has something.","And we should tell a grown-up when we are hungry.’"],"alt":"A teacher smiles at two children sharing lunch.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d881fed2964a436619b554b62dd3b6341ce2d794647b73cbf774e1deccda2d64","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:cf99523818a1aaa8c98bc100edb4eb56c2cba5826fab4b40805bee3ba88eb8c6","durationMs":13880,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,2163],[2163,5526],[5526,9468],[9468,13880]],"words":[[0,535],[535,1071],[1071,1392],[1392,2163],[2163,2592],[2592,2913],[2913,3513],[3513,4434],[4434,4755],[4755,5526],[5526,5955],[5955,6169],[6169,6876],[6876,7840],[7840,8161],[8161,9468],[9468,9789],[9789,10003],[10003,10646],[10646,11074],[11074,11181],[11181,11931],[11931,12359],[12359,12573],[12573,12895],[12895,13880]]}}},{"n":7,"text":"The next day, Ayeley put her lunch box in her bag. She checked it twice. At break time, she opened it. She had extra: two oranges.","sentences":["The next day, Ayeley put her lunch box in her bag.","She checked it twice.","At break time, she opened it.","She had extra: two oranges."],"alt":"A girl opens a lunch box with two oranges inside.","image":{"hash":"sha256:b42a362a53a0d84ad2aa8e0f3c696e9692c48da5a9cdbe72b72aeffe34e570ec","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:dcf39f6d40fd08f34a661d649862d13e60cb349c3273246801cca625857da74f","durationMs":17720,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,6561],[6561,9657],[9657,13765],[13765,17720]],"words":[[0,460],[460,1073],[1073,1778],[1778,2698],[2698,3158],[3158,3618],[3618,4384],[4384,4844],[4844,5150],[5150,5610],[5610,6561],[6561,7021],[7021,8094],[8094,8400],[8400,9657],[9657,9964],[9964,10730],[10730,11589],[11589,12048],[12048,12968],[12968,13765],[13765,14225],[14225,14685],[14685,15697],[15697,16156],[16156,17720]]}}},{"n":8,"text":"‘One for you,’ said Ayeley, and she gave an orange to Kofitse. They peeled their oranges together. Sharing made them both feel good. The end.","sentences":["‘One for you,’ said Ayeley, and she gave an orange to Kofitse.","They peeled their oranges together.","Sharing made them both feel good.","The end."],"alt":"Two children peel oranges together and smile.","image":{"hash":"sha256:d1c8321dcb188e45765d9eae5e4a47ca75e19b159bf3a75e6990bee431e3740f","width":960,"height":717},"audio":{"hash":"sha256:db13c201fd7276d32c9ca5534e2087a8b1f41f35972b71e0af895e701af211df","durationMs":22600,"timing":{"granularity":"word","method":"tts-marks","verified":true,"sentences":[[0,9474],